{"slug":"/students/subjects/biology/foundations/classification/","source":"students/subjects/biology/foundations/classification.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Classification & Organisation of Life | Biology","description":"","subject":"biology","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/foundations/\" class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700\">← Back to Foundations</a>\n        </nav>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Classification &amp; Organisation of Life</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Understanding how living things are organized and categorized</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Learning Objectives</h2>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>• Understand the principles of biological classification</li>\n                        <li>• Identify the major kingdoms of life and their characteristics</li>\n                        <li>• Use taxonomic hierarchies to classify organisms</li>\n                        <li>• Apply classification keys to identify specimens</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Video Content -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Video Lessons</h2>\n                    <div class=\"aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 mb-4\">\n                        <iframe title=\"Classification Introduction\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"w-full h-[400px] rounded-lg\"></iframe>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 1: Introduction to Classification</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Basic principles and importance of classification in biology</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 2: The Five Kingdoms</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Overview of major kingdoms and their distinguishing features</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Key Concepts -->\n                <section class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Key Concepts</h2>\n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Principles of Classification</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Need for classification</li>\n                            <li>• Basis of classification</li>\n                            <li>• Types of classification systems</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Taxonomic Hierarchy</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Kingdom → Phylum → Class → Order → Family → Genus → Species</li>\n                            <li>• Binomial nomenclature</li>\n                            <li>• Scientific naming conventions</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. The Five Kingdoms</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Monera (bacteria)</li>\n                            <li>• Protista</li>\n                            <li>• Fungi</li>\n                            <li>• Plantae</li>\n                            <li>• Animalia</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">4. Modern Classification</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Three-domain system</li>\n                            <li>• Role of molecular biology</li>\n                            <li>• Phylogenetic trees</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practical Activities -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practical Activities</h2>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Using Classification Keys</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Dichotomous key practice</li>\n                                <li>• Identifying local specimens</li>\n                                <li>• Creating simple keys</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Specimen Study</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Observing characteristics</li>\n                                <li>• Recording observations</li>\n                                <li>• Group classification activities</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Assessment Questions -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Self-Assessment</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. What is the main purpose of biological classification?</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Think about organization, identification, and relationships between organisms.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Compare and contrast the characteristics of any two kingdoms.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Consider cell structure, nutrition, reproduction, and other key features.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Why is binomial nomenclature important in classification?</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Consider scientific communication and standardization.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}